/T (complex framework of companies, security firms, contractors and freelance operators. The field varies greatly depending on the specialisation of each agency as well as the types of contract they are capable of undertaking and their size. Technically speaking, the private security at a museum and specialised guerrilla units deployable in proxy wars are in the same business, although we intuitively understand how they differ greatly.)
/E (complex framework of companies, security firms, contractors and freelance operators. The field varies greatly depending on the specialisation of each agency as well as the types of contract they are capable of undertaking and their size. Technically speaking, the private security at a museum and specialised guerrilla units deployable in proxy wars are in the same business, although we intuitively understand how they differ greatly.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1]
>>
