/E (The war in Gaza is driving up the numbers but threats to aid workers extend beyond Gaza with high levels of violence, kidnappings, injuries, harassment and arbitrary detention being reported in Afghanistan, the Democratic Republic of the Congo, South Sudan, Ukraine and Yemen, among other countries. The violence against aid workers also reflects a broader pattern of civilian harm in conflict zones. )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [2]
>>
